  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "What You Will Love About Sunny Seagrove<br><br>Sunny Seagrove welcomes you into a beautifully updated coastal cottage designed for relaxed gatherings and effortless beach living. Inside, the open-concept first floor feels light and inviting, with crisp white shiplap walls, navy accents, and natural textures that set a calm coastal tone. The living area is thoughtfully arranged with a cozy linen sofa, armchairs, and a flat-screen TV centered around the mantle, creating a perfect spot for winding down after the beach. A spacious dining table seats ten comfortably, while the adjacent kitchen features stainless-steel appliances, stone countertops, and a convenient breakfast bar that keeps everyone connected during meals. A guest bedroom with two full beds and a nearby shared bath adds flexibility on the main level, along with a queen sleeper sofa for additional guests. Upstairs, two generous king suites offer private retreats, each with its own bathroom. The Primary suite feels especially indulgent with a walk-in shower, soaking tub, and balcony access overlooking the treetops, while the second king suite provides a private bath with a shower and tub. Thoughtful coastal artwork and details throughout the home complete the relaxed yet polished feel.<br><br>What You Will Love About Gulf Mist<br><br>Set within the charming Gulf Mist community, Sunny Seagrove offers a peaceful neighborhood atmosphere just moments from the beach. Guests enjoy access to a refreshing community pool tucked behind classic white picket fencing and framed by palm trees, making it an inviting spot for mid-day swims or laid-back afternoons. The streets are quiet and walkable, ideal for morning strolls or easy bike rides, while the home’s front porch and backyard spaces provide multiple outdoor areas to relax and enjoy the coastal breeze.<br><br>What You Will Love About Seagrove Beach<br><br>Located in the heart of Seagrove Beach along scenic 30A, Sunny Seagrove places you just 0.1 miles from not one, but two beach access points directly across the street. In under two minutes, you can be walking along sugar-white sand and emerald waters. The area is known for its laid-back charm, bike-friendly paths, and beloved local dining, including nearby favorites like Café Thirty-A, Angelina’s Pizzeria, and Prema Organic Café. With four complimentary adult bikes included, it’s easy to cruise to Seaside, explore the scenic trails, or head out for coffee, shopping, and sunset dinners without ever needing to drive.<br><br>What You Will Love About Ocean Reef<br><br>A stay at Sunny Seagrove is made seamless by the trusted care of Ocean Reef Resorts. Professional management and 24/7 guest support ensure peace of mind from arrival through departure, allowing you to focus fully on enjoying your time at the beach. Guests also receive exclusive perks, including discounts on golf, tennis, and beach rentals, adding extra value to your stay. With Ocean Reef Resorts handling the details, every moment feels easy, relaxed, and perfectly suited for memorable days along 30A.<br><br>First Floor: Living Room with Patio Access and Queen Sleeper Sofa, Kitchen, Dining, Guest Bedroom with Two Full Beds, Shared Bathroom with Shower/Tub Combo.<br><br>Second Floor: King Primary Bedroom with Balcony Access and Private Bathroom with Walk-In-Shower + Soaking Tub, King Bedroom with Shower/Tub Combo.<br><br>*Note – This property may have date restrictions that apply. All reservations submitted online are a request until receiving an email confirmation from Ocean Reef Resorts. For more details, please review our Minimum Night Stay under Rental Policies. An e-signed rental agreement is required prior to arrival.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
